ling.**📋 **STANDING DUTIES, ALL RUN, ALL REPRODUCING THEIR BANKED FIGURES.** **ART audit**: `6 areas scanned, 1032 files` (corpus header HELD against s2630), **`AT RISK 0 · LOCAL-ONLY 0`**, SALVAGED 803 / 605.50 MB. **§2E untracked durability (main)**: `AT RISK 0 · UNREFERENCED 2 · LOCAL-REF-ONLY 4 · SAFE 91`, retention verdict **6/6 preserved, 23/23 parts origin-reachable** — reproducing the banked set EXACTLY; newest non-SAFE mtime `2026-09-05T07:05:42.625Z` (a TIMESTAMP, not a derived age). **Modified-tracked census**: `482 / 447.9 MB / 25 trees`, **ZERO factory-side**, FLAT against s2625/s2628/s2630; could-not-answer `26` (HOLLOW 21 · HOLDING 5 · UNVERIFIABLE 0), the 5 HOLDING being the known `wt-*` scratchpads. **Ledger mirror exposure**: `946` keys, **`0` account-class, `0` unrecognised**, `✅ CLEAN`. **LB-01** DISCHARGED on the genuine `:34` exit (*“already present for today”*, `ledger-2026-09-18.db`; UTC was `2026-09-18T20:50Z`, well past the `02:00 UTC` supply window), and `ledger-mirror-freshness` reads **WHOLE AND CURRENT, 26/26 days**. **Withheld-evidence audit**: `5` runs / `112` rows / `58` distinct / `3` TRACKED / `55` LOST — reproducing F-2477-1 to the digit, i.e. NO new withholding, as expected with no lane dispatch under the wall. **GZ-01 sweep**: `examined 5962` against s2630’s banked `5956` — **UP 6, a RISE**, so F-2623-1’s falling-count control PASSED (and I verified `5956` by reading it out of the archive rather than inheriting the claim); `player-path` HELD at `394`, `cited 394`, **`candidates 0`**. Budget read from the HEAD of a whole capture, never `| tail` (F-2599-1): `2026-W38: 3 standalone, 8 batched`, spent well over, so any ITEM would have been ROUNDUP-CLASS. Filed ONE `NOT PLAYER-VISIBLE` paragraph with **no hash token** (the zero-candidate polarity, F-2626-1); pointer re-based `2012 → 2014` (**+2, predicted in writing before the splice**, helper rolls back on disagreement), **baseline re-pinned in the SAME commit** (F-2590-2) — `--upda