sured the defect: 30/30 green** (desktop 10/10, mobile 20/20 incl. the sibling test), where the defect was 8/20 red. `tsc --noEmit` clean. ⓘ **`logs/suite-red-inventory.md` rows `:107`/`:347` are now STALE and are deliberately NOT hand-edited** — it is generated from a full-suite run and self-corrects on regeneration (s1335 §I(4)). 💡 **THE ORIGINAL FINDING'S CLASS SURVIVES ITS CLOSURE, and it is worth more than the fix:** a red's **scope qualifier** is a claim with its own denominator, and it is the part of an inventory row nobody re-runs. So is its **shape** — `MOBILE-ONLY` and *"deterministic red"* both look like properties of the bug; both were summaries of the runs somebody happened to do. **ORIGINAL FINDING, s1287, retained verbatim:**
